  "question": {
    "text": "In acidiic medium Zn reduces nitrate ion to <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> ion according to the reaction<br />\r<br />\r<math>\r <mrow>\r  <mtext>Zn</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>+</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><msubsup>\r   <mrow>\r    <mtext>NO</mtext></mrow>\r   <mn>3</mn>\r   <mo>&#x2212;</mo>\r  </msubsup>\r  <mo>&#x2192;</mo><msup>\r   <mrow>\r    <mtext>Zn</mtext></mrow>\r   <mrow>\r    <mtext>2+</mtext></mrow>\r  </msup>\r  <mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>+</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><msubsup>\r   <mrow>\r    <mtext>NH</mtext></mrow>\r   <mtext>4</mtext>\r   <mtext>+</mtext>\r  </msubsup>\r  <mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><mtext>+</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><msub>\r   <mtext>H</mtext>\r   <mtext>2</mtext>\r  </msub>\r  <mtext>O&#x00A0;&#x00A0;&#x00A0;&#x00A0;</mtext></mrow>\r</math>\r(unbalanced)<br />\r<br />\rHow many moles of HCl are required to reduce half a mole of <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub></math> completely? Assume the availability of sufficient Zn."
