  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mo>∴</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>10</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>⟶</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>(Net equation)<br />Here <math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext>H</mtext> <mtext>+</mtext> </msup> </mrow> </math> will be obtained from <math> <mrow> <mtext>HCl</mtext></mrow> </math><br /><math><mo>∵</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math>mole of <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> (0r <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>)</mo></math> is reduced by<br />=10 moles of HCl<br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> mole of <math><msubsup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msubsup></math> will be reduced by<br />= <math><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math>moles of HCl<br />= 5 moles of HCl"
